{"code":"057030","name":"YBM넷","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"교육서비스","sector_desc":"학원·온라인 교육·교재. 학령 인구와 교육 정책 변화에 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 2000년 온라인교육, 데이터베이스업 및 교육서비스업 등을 위해 설립되었으며, 2004년 코스닥시장에 상장되었음. 한국의 이러닝 산업을 선도하는 기업으로 B2C 및 B2B 온라인교육, 어학시험 온라인접수 대행, 주니어 교육, 디바이스 판매 등을 하고 있음. AI 튜터로 학습 몰입도를 높이고, AI 기반 평가 시스템으로 디지털 전환을 이끌며 IT 솔루션 및 콘텐츠를 해외 수출하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":1999.0,"open":1980.0,"high":2010.0,"low":1938.0,"volume":16962,"amount":33907038.0,"ret_1d":0.9086,"gap":-0.0505,"range_pct":3.6018,"ret_5":-0.794,"ret_20":-4.3541,"ret_60":-4.5823,"ret_120":-28.8612,"ret_250":-37.9193,"ma20":2064.25,"ma60":2120.75,"ma120":2207.625,"ma200":2460.225,"close_vs_ma200":-18.7473,"close_vs_ma60":-5.7409,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-29.4088,"r2_60":0.614,"slope_120":-33.8861,"r2_120":0.5344,"slope_250":-40.3574,"r2_250":0.8916,"high52":3260.0,"low52":1930.0,"pos_52w":5.188,"dd_52w":-38.681,"mdd_1y":-37.8022,"atr14_pct":4.6309,"vol_ann_60":22.2425,"vol_avg20":17887.45,"vol_ratio20":0.9483,"vr5":0.7063,"vr20":0.6551,"amount_avg5":24517099.6,"amount_avg20":36673696.15,"amount_avg60":35728784.55,"obv_chg20":-20.5096,"turnover_20":2.1931,"pv_eff_20":-1.9854,"rsi14":40.5587,"frgn_net_5":140.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0009,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0009,"frgn_net_20":6220.0,"inst_net_20":2797.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0381,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0171,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0553,"frgn_net_60":11427.0,"inst_net_60":2797.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.07,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0171,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0872,"frgn_net_120":43666.0,"inst_net_120":2797.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2677,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0171,"smart_net_120_pct":0.2848,"foreign_ratio":2.62,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.03,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":3.0,"op_margin_q":2.459,"op_qoq":-40.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":250.0,"rev_yoy":1.6667,"op_trend_4q":-15.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":3.57,"debt_ratio":54.24,"per":17.69,"pbr":0.62,"div_yield":5.0,"foreign_rate":2.62,